# Startup refusal messages: one case per line, "name<TAB>error" (<nil> = runs).
# Generated from upstream/main 1d8faa0c (before the router contract); every line is that
# commit's exact message, except the cases marked "changed:", which carry the old message on
# the line below (see PR #2022, "Known, deliberate differences"). Regenerate a changed line
# only with the reason; any other diff is a translation bug.
config-malformed	gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: failed to parse config - failed to decode configuration JSON/YAML: yaml: line 1: did not find expected node content
double-blocksize-redis	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "precise-prefix-cache-producer" cuts block keys every 64 tokens, but the simulated engines' KV block size is 16; set tokenProcessorConfig.blockSizeTokens to 16
# changed: double-discovery-before-metrics-path	was: gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "token-producer" discovers render endpoints (vllm.endpointDiscovery), probing pods on its own schedule outside the simulation; give its vLLM backend a fixed url, or use the estimate backend
double-discovery-before-metrics-path	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "metrics-data-source" scrapes "/stats"; the simulated vLLM servers serve their metrics at /metrics
# changed: double-extractor-before-metrics-path	was: gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "core-metrics-extractor" reads the "sglang" engine's metrics (pod label llm-d.ai/engine-type or defaultEngine); the simulated engines publish vLLM's series (vllm:num_requests_waiting, vllm:num_requests_running, vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc, vllm:num_preemptions_total, vllm:cache_config_info, vllm:lora_requests_info)
double-extractor-before-metrics-path	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "metrics-data-source" scrapes "/stats"; the simulated vLLM servers serve their metrics at /metrics
# changed: double-metrics-path-before-blocksize	was: gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "metrics-data-source" scrapes "/stats"; the simulated vLLM servers serve their metrics at /metrics
double-metrics-path-before-blocksize	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "precise-prefix-cache-producer" cuts block keys every 64 tokens, but the simulated engines' KV block size is 16; set tokenProcessorConfig.blockSizeTokens to 16
double-metrics-path-before-discovery	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "metrics-data-source" scrapes "/stats"; the simulated vLLM servers serve their metrics at /metrics
# changed: double-objective-selector-plugin	was: gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: failed to load the configuration - plugin instantiation failed: failed to create plugin 'session-affinity-scorer' (type: session-affinity-scorer): the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "session-affinity-scorer" (type session-affinity-scorer): the simulated workload sends no session header
double-objective-selector-plugin	gateway: InferenceObjective and InferenceModelRewrite manifests have no effect with --endpoint-selector: the router runs their reconcilers only for an InferencePool (--pool-name)
# changed: double-pool-missing-extractor	was: gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "core-metrics-extractor" reads the "sglang" engine's metrics (pod label llm-d.ai/engine-type or defaultEngine); the simulated engines publish vLLM's series (vllm:num_requests_waiting, vllm:num_requests_running, vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc, vllm:num_preemptions_total, vllm:cache_config_info, vllm:lora_requests_info)
double-pool-missing-extractor	gateway: --pool-name=nope: no InferencePool default/nope in the manifests
# changed: double-topology-peer-unplaced	was: gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-affinity-filter peerTopologyHeader requires a coordinator; BLIS embeds one EPP
double-topology-peer-unplaced	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: instance instance_0 has no simulated host placement (node count 0)
extractor-custom	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "core-metrics-extractor" requires engine series the simulated engines do not publish: queuedRequestsSpec "vllm:nope", custom metric "vllm:gpu_cache_usage_perc" (published: vllm:num_requests_waiting, vllm:num_requests_running, vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc, vllm:num_preemptions_total, vllm:cache_config_info, vllm:lora_requests_info)
extractor-label	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "core-metrics-extractor" reads the "sglang" engine's metrics (pod label llm-d.ai/engine-type or defaultEngine); the simulated engines publish vLLM's series (vllm:num_requests_waiting, vllm:num_requests_running, vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc, vllm:num_preemptions_total, vllm:cache_config_info, vllm:lora_requests_info)
extractor-sglang	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "core-metrics-extractor" reads the "sglang" engine's metrics (pod label llm-d.ai/engine-type or defaultEngine); the simulated engines publish vLLM's series (vllm:num_requests_waiting, vllm:num_requests_running, vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc, vllm:num_preemptions_total, vllm:cache_config_info, vllm:lora_requests_info)
flags-bad	gateway: EPP flags: unknown flag: --no-such-flag
flags-config-file	gateway: EPP flag --config-file: open /nonexistent/x.yaml: no such file or directory
flags-extra-args	gateway: EPP flags: unexpected arguments ["stray"]
flags-legacy-metric	gateway: EPP flags: flag "total-queued-requests-metric" is deprecated and cannot be used; configure metrics via engineConfigs in EndpointPickerConfig instead
guide-flow-control.yaml	<nil>
guide-optimized-baseline.yaml	gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: failed to load the configuration - plugin instantiation failed: failed to create plugin 'prefix-cache-affinity-filter' (type: prefix-cache-affinity-filter): the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "prefix-cache-affinity-filter" (type prefix-cache-affinity-filter): it consumes the external latency predictor
guide-pd-disaggregation.yaml	gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: failed to load the configuration - plugin instantiation failed: failed to create plugin 'prefix-cache-affinity-filter' (type: prefix-cache-affinity-filter): the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "prefix-cache-affinity-filter" (type prefix-cache-affinity-filter): it consumes the external latency predictor
guide-precise-on-16	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "precise-prefix-cache-producer" cuts block keys every 64 tokens, but the simulated engines' KV block size is 16; set tokenProcessorConfig.blockSizeTokens to 16
guide-precise-prefix-cache-routing.yaml	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "precise-prefix-cache-producer" cuts block keys every 64 tokens, but the simulated engines' KV block size is 16; set tokenProcessorConfig.blockSizeTokens to 16
guide-tiered-prefix-cache-cpu.yaml	<nil>
guide-wide-ep.yaml	gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: failed to load the configuration - plugin instantiation failed: failed to create plugin 'disaggregatedset-rollout-screener' (type: disaggregatedset-rollout-screener): the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "disaggregatedset-rollout-screener" (type disaggregatedset-rollout-screener): its revision split draws from process-wide randomness
manifest-pod	gateway: manifest document 0: a Pod manifest cannot be simulated: BLIS creates the model-server pods from the scenario
manifest-strict	gateway: manifest document 0: strict decoding error: unknown field "spec.priorty"
manifest-unserved	gateway: manifest document 0: llm-d.ai/v9 InferenceObjective is not served by the router's CRDs (inference.networking.k8s.io/v1 InferencePool, llm-d.ai/v1 InferenceObjective, llm-d.ai/v1alpha2 InferenceModelRewrite, llm-d.ai/v1alpha2 InferenceObjective)
manifest-yaml	gateway: manifest document 0: error converting YAML to JSON: yaml: line 1: did not find expected node content
metrics-path	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "metrics-data-source" scrapes "/stats"; the simulated vLLM servers serve their metrics at /metrics
objective-with-selector	gateway: InferenceObjective and InferenceModelRewrite manifests have no effect with --endpoint-selector: the router runs their reconcilers only for an InferencePool (--pool-name)
pd-flat	gateway: the deployment has prefill and decode pools, but the router configuration has no disagg-profile-handler, so the router would serve every request from one flat pool; state a disaggregating configuration in the scenario's router block (endpoint_picker_config; for example examples/llm-d/pd.yaml)
placed-stamp-header	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-stamp-handler headerName "x-other" is not supported; use "x-peer-topology"
placed-stamp-noextractor	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-stamp-handler needs topology-extractor "topology-extractor"; without it the plugin has no topology to use
placed-stamp-profile	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-stamp-handler profileName "nope" has no scheduling profile
placed-topology-hostname	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-extractor hostname label "example.com/node" is not supported; synthetic Pods use "kubernetes.io/hostname"
placed-topology-noextractor	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-affinity-filter needs topology-extractor "topology-extractor"; without it the plugin has no topology to use
placed-topology-peer	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-affinity-filter peerTopologyHeader requires a coordinator; BLIS embeds one EPP
placed-topology-wrongproducer	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-affinity-filter needs topology-extractor "topology-b"; without it the plugin has no topology to use
plugin-redis	gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: failed to load the configuration - plugin instantiation failed: failed to create plugin 'redis-syncer' (type: redis-syncer): the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "redis-syncer" (type redis-syncer): it synchronizes through an external Redis
plugin-session	gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: failed to load the configuration - plugin instantiation failed: failed to create plugin 'session-affinity-scorer' (type: session-affinity-scorer): the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "session-affinity-scorer" (type session-affinity-scorer): the simulated workload sends no session header
plugin-unaudited	gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: failed to load the configuration - configuration validation failed: plugin type 'no-such-type-xyz' is not registered
pool-missing	gateway: --pool-name=nope: no InferencePool default/nope in the manifests
pool-two	gateway: the manifests define 2 InferencePools; a simulation runs one router for one pool
pool-with-selector	gateway: the manifests define an InferencePool but the EPP flags select a standalone pool (--endpoint-selector); pass --pool-name
precise-blocksize	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "precise-prefix-cache-producer" cuts block keys every 64 tokens, but the simulated engines' KV block size is 16; set tokenProcessorConfig.blockSizeTokens to 16
precise-costaware	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "precise-prefix-cache-producer" uses the cost-aware index, whose lookups range a sync.Map in no fixed order
precise-engine	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "precise-prefix-cache-producer" reads sglang KV events; the simulated engines publish vLLM's
precise-lora	gateway: llm-d router: failed to parse configuration: invalid configuration - precise-prefix-cache-producer requires a token-producer plugin with a vllm backend
precise-redis	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "precise-prefix-cache-producer" keeps its index in Redis, an external service
target-ports	gateway: the pool has 2 target ports [8000 8001]; BLIS simulates each data-parallel rank as its own pod with one port, so give the pool a single target port
token-discovery	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: plugin "token-producer" discovers render endpoints (vllm.endpointDiscovery), probing pods on its own schedule outside the simulation; give its vLLM backend a fixed url, or use the estimate backend
topology-hostname	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-extractor hostname label "example.com/node" is not supported; synthetic Pods use "kubernetes.io/hostname"
