topology-noextractor	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: instance instance_0 has no simulated host placement (node count 0)
# changed: topology-peer	was: gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-affinity-filter peerTopologyHeader requires a coordinator; BLIS embeds one EPP
topology-peer	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: instance instance_0 has no simulated host placement (node count 0)
# changed: topology-stamp-header	was: gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: topology-stamp-handler headerName "x-other" is not supported; use "x-peer-topology"
topology-stamp-header	gateway: the router configuration cannot be simulated faithfully: instance instance_0 has no simulated host placement (node count 0)
